{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0294_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "ec4747fdb645949054f5e7316d00829b315a0fa94bf3506f8d9a45255606053b", "ja": "ふふっ、{$P$}さんも\nそう思いますか？　それでは、仲間を増やしましょー！", "zh": "呵呵，{$P$}先生也这么想吗？那我们就增加同伴吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
